    turnFlow: "1. **Trump Determination**: Eldest hand can 'Stand' or 'Beg'. If they beg, the dealer either gifts 1 point to the opponent or deals 3 more cards to each player to find a new trump suit. 2. **Trick Play**: Winner of the lead (or eldest) leads the first trick. Players must follow suit if they can, or they may trump. 3. **Winning**: Highest trump wins. If no trumps, the highest card of the led suit wins. 4. **Point Capture**: Points are ONLY awarded for the following cards IN THE TRUMP SUIT: \n   - **Ten**: 10 points\n   - **Five**: 5 points\n   - **Ace**: 4 points\n   - **King**: 3 points\n   - **Queen**: 2 points\n   - **Jack**: 1 point\n5. **Total**: There are 25 total points available in each hand. The first to reach 61 wins.",
